; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\車内.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\特別部隊運転席.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"All right, we'll be there in 10 minutes."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―What is that thing? That ridiculously huge cherry tree...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I haven't been told the details either. All we have to do is follow orders."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―And if we find survivors, we're to kill them...<PG>
"What? You scared?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―N-no, it's not that!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Is that so. Honestly, I'm scared, though."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Well, sure, it means killing ordinary people who don't know anything...<PG>
"That's not it. I mean the target."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―The target?
{PAUSE ""}
　If I recall, the CO said '<STYLE ID="1" RUBY="しんし">divine messenger</STYLE>,' right?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"This 'divine messenger' is supposedly something like the culprit of the Megasawa City case."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―The Megasawa City case?
{PAUSE ""}
　Now that you mention it, I think there was a case like that when I was a kid...<PG>
"Yeah, you young guys wouldn't know about it. 
{PAUSE ""}
Supposedly they kill with movements you'd never think were human. 
{PAUSE ""}
Word is they can even dodge bullets."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―That's what we're up against!? Nobody told us that!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's why a specially trained unit like ours is being sent in."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―............<PG>
"So you are scared?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―N-no! I'm fine!
{PAUSE ""}
　Besides...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hm?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―I'm getting married at the end of this month...<PG>
"Don't go jinxing yourself..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―B-but that's exactly why I want to complete the mission and get back home!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You really think you'll make it back safe?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Huh?<PG>
"Monsters like that running around, us sneaking into a city buried in cherry blossoms. 
{PAUSE ""}
You think they'd just send us home free and clear, after we've learned something that big?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Wait a minute...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Don't take it seriously. I'm joking. 
{PAUSE ""}
The government's real aim is probably to test whether we can make it back safely."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―A test...?<PG>
"Whether it's a place people with full gear and training can come back from alive. 
{PAUSE ""}
If we don't come back, this place will probably become a no-entry zone forever."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―............
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Listen, if it comes down to it, you get out of there, even if you're the only one."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―B-but running away by myself...<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\パトカー通話ノイズ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
"All vehicles, do you read? This is Car 1. We're nearly at the center of Motoki City. 
{PAUSE ""}
The mission is the <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="せんめつ">elimination</STYLE> of survivors and the 'divine messengers'. 
{PAUSE ""}
However, if you sense you're in danger, get out immediately. 
{PAUSE ""}
Running is part of your orders too. Out."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―............
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, your odds of getting married just went up."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Y-yes!<PG>
"Right, we're getting out. First we search the city center, then move out toward the outskirts. 
{PAUSE ""}
Stay on your guard!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Yes!
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------